<article class="dorothy-showcase">
  <p class="dorothy-title"><strong>Dorothy Ann</strong></p>
  <p class="dorothy-intro">My default search engine, a la everyone's favourite intrepid and insatiably curious Magic School Bus student. Explore a question, follow the sources, and see where an answer is solid—and where it needs to stay uncertain.</p>

  <section class="dorothy-gallery" aria-label="Dorothy Ann screenshots">
